The '''Asgarnian Ice Dungeon''' is a moderately large [[dungeon]] in [[Asgarnia]]. It is found south of [[Port Sarim]] and north of [[Mudskipper Point]], {{fairycode|aiq}}, under a trapdoor. Look for the red exclamation sign ([[File:Dungeon map link icon.png]]) on the [[minimap]], which indicates a dungeon. This dungeon is particularly dangerous to low level players, as every single [[monster]] within it is [[aggressive]]. The dungeon is also crucial to the [[The Knight's Sword]] [[quest]] as this is the only location in [[Gielinor]] that contains [[blurite rocks]], allowing players to mine [[blurite ore]].

Three [[Agility]] shortcuts can be found in the dungeon; one just east of the entrance ladder requiring 82 Agility, another in the chamber with muggers requiring 60 Agility, leading them to the ice chamber to the west, and a third right before the ice giants and warriors in the eastern area, requiring 72 Agility. All three are boostable.

The western area of the dungeon leads to the [[Royal Titans]] encounter, and contains six [[ice giant]]s and an [[iron longsword]] spawn. This area is a [[multicombat area]].

If fighting enemies in the dungeon, [[Prayer]] can be restored at the nearby [[Rimmington church]].

==Transportation==
{{Map|x:3008,y:3150|mapID=0|align=left|caption=Location of the Asgarnian Ice Dungeon|mtype=pin|3008,3150|icon=redPin}}
When walking, go to [[Port Sarim]] and head south from the [[Port Sarim jail]], past a grove of [[willow tree]]s. Go up the small hill and you will arrive at the trapdoor.
For faster transportation, players can use:
*(Fastest method) [[Giantsoul amulet]] teleport to [[Royal Titans|Branda and Eldric]].
*[[Fairy ring]] code {{Fairycode|AIQ}}, which goes to [[Mudskipper Point]].
*[[Teleport to House]], if the player has a [[player-owned house]] located in [[Rimmington]].
*[[Minigame Teleport]] to Port Sarim Rat Pits, after completing [[Rat Catchers]].
*An [[amulet of glory]], which can teleport to [[Draynor Village]], the village east of Port Sarim.
*[[Minigame Teleport]] to [[Pest Control]], then take the ship to Port Sarim.
{{clear}}
==Features==
[[File:Blurite rocks.png|thumb|A blurite rock.|150px]]
*[[Blurite rocks]] - Blurite is an [[ore]], and this dungeon is its only location. Blurite is needed for [[The Knight's Sword]] quest. Players can also make the [[blurite crossbow]] and [[Blurite bolts|bolts]]. There are [[aggressive]] [[Ice giant]]s and [[Ice warrior]]s guarding the rocks. For low level players, it may be advisable to take only a [[pickaxe]] and perhaps lots of [[food]] when attempting to mine the ore.

[[File:Skeletal wyvern upper area.png|thumb|right|The upper area where fourteen additional skeletal wyverns are found.]]

*[[Skeletal Wyvern]]s - The skeletal wyverns are [[Slayer monsters]] requiring a [[Slayer]] level of 72 to fight. Either an [[Elemental shield|elemental]] or [[mind shield]], or a [[dragonfire shield]], [[ancient wyvern shield]], or [[dragonfire ward]], are necessary to avoid taking heavy damage from their ice breath attack. They can drop [[granite legs]], [[dragon plateskirt]]s, [[dragon platelegs]], as well as the [[draconic visage]]. 
**A task-only area near the entrance can be accessed, though players will only be able to attack them while on task; otherwise, [[Steve]] or [[Pieve]] will stop them from doing so.

*[[Royal Titans]] - The Royal Titans encounter can be found in the western area of the dungeon, where players can fight [[Eldric the Ice King]] and [[Branda the Fire Queen]].

